  "descriptions": {
    "_about": "Descriptions assembled ONLY from verbatim sentences of the listed source captions (selection + trimming of hooks, questions, contact lines and prices). No new claims.",
    "zululami-ocean-view-residence": "This exceptional brand-new residence in Zululami Luxury Coastal Estate has been designed around exactly that idea: homes that make the coastline part of everyday life.\n\nPositioned to capture sweeping views across the Indian Ocean, the home combines contemporary architecture, exceptional finishes and the unmistakable feeling of living in one of KwaZulu-Natal’s most sought-after coastal estates.\n\nThe expansive open-plan kitchen, dining and lounge area flows seamlessly onto a generous entertainment verandah, landscaped garden and private swimming pool. Upstairs, a dedicated pyjama lounge creates another private space to relax while enjoying the magnificent ocean outlook.",
    "zululami-sea-view-new-build": "A brand-new luxury residence offering contemporary living, breathtaking sea views and effortless indoor-outdoor living.\n\nA home designed for those who appreciate space, style and the coastal lifestyle.",
    "southdowns-family-home": "Welcome to one of Southdowns Estate's most impressive family homes. Every space has been thoughtfully designed for comfortable family living and effortless entertaining.",
    "green-point-ocean-view-apartment": "Experience panoramic ocean, harbour, and city views from this beautifully furnished 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom apartment. Featuring light-filled open-plan living, premium finishes, concierge security, inverter backup power, and effortless lock-up-and-go convenience.\n\nJust moments from the V&A Waterfront, Sea Point Promenade, top restaurants, and Cape Town’s iconic beaches.",
    "eye-of-africa-single-storey-home": "A modern single-storey home in the well known Eye of Africa estate, with a secure estate setting, scenic surroundings and restaurants minutes away.",
    "senderwood-income-property": "Prime large freehold property in a secure enclosure: a 4-bedroom house with 3 cottages. All units are fitted with prepaid water and electricity meters.",
    "clifton-nettleton-road-residence": "Set on the iconic Nettleton Road, this architectural masterpiece offers uninterrupted views of Clifton’s beaches, the Atlantic Ocean and the Twelve Apostles.\n\nFour generously sized bedrooms, all en-suite. A wellness centre, including a gym and sauna. An infinity pool and multiple entertainment spaces, with floor-to-ceiling glass throughout.",
    "strathavon-four-level-residence": "A statement of pure luxury in Strathavon’s most exclusive enclave.",
    "bryanston-two-bedroom-apartment": "Located in Bryanston, just a stone’s throw away from the Bryanston shopping centre, with 24-hour security, two secured parking spaces and a swimming pool.",
    "zimbali-fairway-lake-residence": "Refined luxury with fairway, lake and gentle sea views.",
    "camps-bay-five-bedroom-home": "Whether you are seeking a place to call your forever home or are a keen investor, this 5-bedroom Camps Bay home features multiple living areas and an entertainment area and pool with a sea view.",
    "seaton-estate-residence": "An architectural masterpiece in the prestigious Seaton Estate offering modern luxury, clean design, and effortless indoor-outdoor living.",
    "thaba-eco-village-apartment": "A one-bedroom home in Thaba Eco Village, a secure eco-estate with basketball and padel courts, a swimming pool, skate park, gym and private school.",
    "bantry-bay-multi-level-apartment": "Stylish 3-bedroom, 3.5-bathroom apartment just moments from Cape Town’s iconic beaches.\n\nDesigned across multiple levels with elegant en-suite bedrooms, a sleek Miele kitchen, and seamless indoor-outdoor living. Includes a private pool, parking for 2 cars, inverter, and top-tier privacy.",
    "midstream-heights-brand-new-home": "Brand new home in Midstream Heights.",
    "zululami-three-bedroom-home": "Coastal living in Zululami Estate, near Sheffield Beach: three bedrooms, a private garden, a balcony and secure estate living, with a fitness park within the estate.",
    "alkmaar-42-hectare-farm": "Spanning 42 hectares of fertile land near Nelspruit, this repossessed farm includes a 3-hectare dam, a macadamia orchard of 300 trees under irrigation, a licensed bar by the dam, and off-grid water and energy security.",
    "st-francis-links-home": "Style, design, and comfort.",
    "oakdene-three-bedroom-apartment": "A secure 3-bedroom apartment in Oakdene, Johannesburg South, minutes from Pantry gourmet grocery store. No transfer duty.",
    "oakdene-three-bedroom-home": "A 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom home in Oakdene with 2 carports.",
    "midstream-ridge-greenbelt-home": "Greenbelt elegance in Midstream Ridge.",
    "eye-of-africa-double-storey-home": "Space, comfort, convenience and views, in the well known Eye of Africa Golf Estate.",
    "zimbali-ilanga-villa": "There’s something about Zimbali that makes you slow down. The trees, the coastline, the privacy, and then you come home to iLanga Villa, where the outside becomes part of the way you live.\n\nThe living areas open completely onto the garden and covered patio, with a built-in braai. All three bedrooms have their own bathrooms, and the double garage keeps everything as convenient as the setting. Owners buy into Zimbali Coastal Estate, with access to Bushbuck Club, surrounded by coastal forest and walking trails.",
    "elaleni-the-woods-home": "A brand-new home in one of the North Coast’s most sought-after lifestyle estates with no transfer duty.\n\nThis 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom home in The Woods 2 at Elaleni is designed around easy, modern coastal living. The open-plan kitchen, dining and living area opens onto a covered patio and private garden. Upstairs, the main bedroom has its own en-suite, with two additional bedrooms sharing a modern bathroom.\n\nOwners have access to forest trails, clubhouse facilities, swimming pools, the Leisure Centre, children’s play areas and padel courts.",
    "palm-lakes-family-home": "Set within the sought-after Palm Lakes Estate, this elegant 4-bedroom residence combines contemporary design, generous entertainment spaces and everything a family needs for comfortable North Coast living.\n\nThe estate offers a clubhouse and restaurant, swimming pools, a lazy tube ride, a 25m training pool, a soccer field, fishing dams, nature trails, walking and jogging paths, and cycling routes.",
    "ballito-sea-view-apartment": "A beautifully presented 2-bedroom apartment with 2 bathrooms, partial sea views and a private balcony. Positioned close to Ballito’s beaches, restaurants and shopping, with secure parking."
